<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71288" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφ-ίος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bridegroom,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδὸς ὀδύρεται ὀστέα καίων
				&lt;&gt;φίου</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.223
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν μὲν ἄκουρον ἐόντα βάλ᾽ . .
					νυμφίον ἐν μεγάρῳ μίαν οἴην παῖδα λιπόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.65
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμόζων κόρᾳ ν. ἄνδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					9.118
				</span></i>
			, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆτε νυμφίων βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					161
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				783e
			</span></i> : in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς νεωστὶ
			νυμφίοις</span> to the <i>bridal</i> pair, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				366
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				757
			</span></i> (lyr.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφίοισι
			παρθένοις</span> occurs in Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				741
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>son-in-law,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				15.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφιος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
			<i>bridal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα νυμφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.16
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέκτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					373
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aezani</span>).</div>
